{"id":"wb-2-12","name":"须弥山石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"须弥山石窟","text":"须弥山石窟位于宁夏回族自治区固原市原州区西北的须弥山上，是一批开凿于北朝至唐代的石窟的总称，部分石窟被开凿于明清时期。该石窟周围曾建有佛教和道教寺庙，但后来全部损毁。此后，石窟群在海原大地震和文化大革命时期曾遭受大规模破坏，后来又因严重风化和遭到盗凿而损毁严重。相关文物部门在二十世纪八十年代后对须弥山石窟进行了多次修缮。近年来，石窟受到风化的破坏。1982年，须弥山石窟被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A1%BB%E5%BC%A5%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":90853628,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90853628","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/08adab1ab4ca0c75518524da.jpg","title":"Xumishan_Grottoes_99.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xumishan_Grottoes_99.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/Xumishan_Grottoes_99.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Thebrainchamber1","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Xumishan Grottoes 99","width":320,"height":180}}